<title>UK: Bayerische Hypo sets 100 mln stg bond. [CORRECTED 14:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bayerische Hypo sets 100 mln stg bond. [CORRECTED 14:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE  L-18.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.20     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> (Corrects S&amp;P rating from AA+ to A+)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT GILT DUE 1999 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
